OL,3,GNEWSALockerbie accused's alleged
OL,4,Aconfession can be used in trial, US
OL,5,Ajudge rules
OL,6,
OL,7,FA copy of an alleged confession by the
OL,8,FLibyan accused of building the bomb
OL,9,Fthat brought down an American airliner
OL,10,Fover Lockerbie 38 years ago can be used
OL,11,Fat his trial, a US judge has ruled.
OL,13,FAbu Agila Mas'ud Kheir Al-Marimi, 74,
OL,14,Fhas claimed he was forced by three
OL,15,Fmasked men into making a false
OL,16,Fconfession while in custody in Libya.
OL,18,FMasud's lawyers asked a federal court
OL,19,Fin Washington to rule the alleged
OL,20,Fconfession inadmissible in advance of
OL,21,Fhis trial in January next year as it
OL,22,Fwas not the original document.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
